## 8. TOKEN BUDGET

⚠️ **Open Gap #8:** The v3.3 token-efficiency figures (~75% reduction, 187.5K vs 750K tokens/month at 300 reviews) were not re-measured this cycle against the real prompt structure. Do not treat these numbers as confirmed. A fresh estimate requires: actual T2/T3 prompt token count from Step 9c/9d, verified T1/T2/T3 distribution from live pilot data, and actual record volume per client per month. Flag as unverified until re-measured.

**What is confirmed:**
- T1 records: zero Claude tokens
- T2/T3 records: one Claude call, `max_tokens: 500`
- T2/T3 percentage: pilot data not yet sufficient to confirm the ~20-30% estimate with confidence

