## 11. KNOWN ISSUES

| # | Issue | Location | Severity | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Step 9b governance check likely fully inert | Step 9b | Medium | Wrong-field bug (same as HSI Step 16). `signal_type === 'Dignity-Risk Signal'` unreachable in T1 lane. `pain_point_sub_category.includes("Trust, Dignity")` references wrong field. 2nd confirmed occurrence of identical bug. See Open Gap #4. |
| 2 | Step 11 Halt Check has no NocoDB error-record write | Step 11 | High | Highest-stakes governance control in the pipeline. Bare `throw` only. Halt events traceable only in n8n execution log — not queryable. Weakest observability of any failure path audited. See Open Gap #5. |
| 3 | Step 9b → Step 10 connection unconfirmed | Connection | Medium | Never observed across any audit batch. Could be partial-export artifact. Needs direct live verification. See Open Gap #3. |
| 4 | Dead patch-body code (Steps 16/17) | Steps 16–17 | Low | 4th confirmed occurrence (EIP, ESS, HSI, BRA). Step 16 computes a value; Step 17 ignores it. See Open Gap #6. |
| 5 | Missing onError/retry on BRA→RDA handoff | Step 19 | Medium | 4th/5th confirmed occurrence across pipeline. Only ALA→EIP has it. See Open Gap #6. |
| 6 | `commercial_risk_flag` not strictly type-validated | Step 9f | Low | Could pass as non-boolean string. No confirmed failure mode. |
| 7 | Step 4 no `skip_reason` logging on duplicate-skip | Step 4 | Low | Every upstream agent logs skip reason. This path drops silently. See Open Gap #9. |

